{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kibreet | \u0643\u0628\u0631\u064a\u062a is a psychological arabfolk horror game set in the early 2000s deep in the deserts of rural Saudi Arabia. You play as a father, estranged from his wife and daughter, returning to their remote village home after a late-night accident on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He carries a box of matches meant to light his daughter\u2019s birthday candles but the house is empty and the silence feels wrong. Every match you strike exposes memories of shame and something watching from the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070190/extras/49d003de36a4eb0f186b156fd565dbe0.poster.avif?t=1760095471\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070190/extras/49d003de36a4eb0f186b156fd565dbe0.webm?t=1760095471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070190/extras/49d003de36a4eb0f186b156fd565dbe0.mp4?t=1760095471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Lighting a match requires precision where a small skillcheck determines whether the flame catches or dies. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological arabfolk horror rooted in early 2000s rural Saudi Arabia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric exploration through a silent village and the haunting home of your family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting realities that blur the line between shame and memory and the supernatural.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1 style visuals with lowpoly environments and gritty filters that heighten unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070190?t=1760095471","backgroun